OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation over 3,339-home
OL,4,A'garden village' plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being urged to share their
OL,7,Fviews on plans to create a new "garden
OL,8,Fvillage" on the site of a former
OL,9,Fairfield near York.
OL,11,FA consultation on plans for Langwith
OL,12,FVillage, which would see almost 3,400
OL,13,Fhomes built at the former Elvington
OL,14,FAirfield, near the Yorkshire Air
OL,15,FMuseum, is due to get under way next
OL,16,Fweek.
OL,18,FThe settlement would feature new
OL,19,Fschools, shops, community and leisure
OL,20,Ffacilities, workplaces and active
OL,21,Ftravel infrastructure, according to
OL,22,Fdevelopers.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
