OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation over 3,339-home
OL,4,A'garden village' plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Procter, of the Langwith
OL,7,FDevelopment Partnership, said the
OL,8,Fconsultation "invites local residents,
OL,9,Fbusinesses and community organisations
OL,10,Fto help shape the next stage of the
OL,11,Fproposals for Langwith Village".
